# AI Source of Truth

The Source of Truth for all AI agents (Gemini, Claude, Cursor, etc.) has been moved to the `.ai` directory.

**MANDATORY**: Before taking any action or answering questions, you MUST read the following files:
1. `.ai/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`
2. `.ai/CURRENT_STATE.md`
3. `.ai/HANDOFF.md`
4. `.ai/TASKS.md`
5. `.ai/DECISIONS.md`

Do not rely on this file for rules. Follow the "Future AI Startup Protocol" defined in `.ai/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`.
